# No automatic commits

Never run `git commit`, stage-and-commit workflows, or propose committing as the next step unless the user explicitly asks to commit in the current message.

- Do not commit "because the work is done"
- Do not commit "to save progress"
- Do not amend, push, or open a PR unless explicitly requested
- If commit readiness comes up, ask first — do not run git commit commands
